					"key": "Code",
					"value": "\tfloat s = enx_ms(px, 0.02);\n\tvec2 d = q + vec2(enx_mn(q * 3.0), enx_mn(q * 3.0 + 9.1)) * 0.6;\n\tfloat blades = enx_mn(vec2(d.x * 90.0, d.y * 18.0)) * 0.6 + enx_mn(vec2(d.x * 25.0 + 4.0, d.y * 130.0)) * 0.4;\n\tfloat spot = enx_mf(q * 0.8, 3);\n\tc *= mix(vec3(1.0), mix(vec3(0.7, 0.8, 0.6), vec3(1.2, 1.14, 0.95), blades), s) * (0.84 + spot * 0.32);\n\th += (blades - 0.5) * 0.01 * s;\n\tr = 0.95;"
				},
				{
					"key": "Inputs",
					"value": "q: vec2, px: float"
				},
				{
					"key": "Outputs",
					"value": "c: vec3, r: float, m: float, h: float"
